{"ticker":"TGT","updated":"2026-11-20T23:22:36Z","profile":{"longName":"Target Corporation","shortName":"Target Corporation","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","country":"United States","website":"https://corporate.target.com","fullTimeEmployees":400000,"marketCap":75076984832,"trailingPE":15.41171,"forwardPE":16.955582,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.68562204,"pegRatio":2.29,"targetMeanPrice":172.34286,"targetHighPrice":210.0,"targetLowPrice":130.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":35,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.071,"earningsGrowth":0.755,"grossMargins":0.28663,"operatingMargins":0.05205,"profitMargins":0.04488,"totalRevenue":109501997056,"beta":0.932,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":171.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":84.24,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.77},"summary":"Target Corporation operates as a general merchandise retailer in the United States. It offers apparel for women, men, young adults, kids, toddlers, and babies, as well as jewelry, accessories, and shoes; and beauty products, such as skin and bath care, cosmetics, hair care, oral care, deodorant, and shaving products. The company also provides food and beverage products comprising dry and perishable grocery, including snacks, candy, beverages, deli, bakery, meat, produce, and food service; electronics which includes video games and consoles, toys, sporting goods, entertainment, and luggage; bed and bath, home décor, school/office supplies, storage, small appliances, kitchenware, greeting cards, party supplies, furniture, lighting, home improvement, and seasonal merchandise; and household essentials, such as household cleaning, paper products, over-the-counter healthcare, vitamins and supplements, baby gear, and pet supplies. In addition, it sells merchandise through periodic design and creative partnerships, and shop-in-shop experience; and in-store amenities. The company sells its products through its stores; and digital channels, including Target.com. Target Corporation was incorporated in 1902 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","summary_zh":"塔吉特公司在美國經營百貨零售商業務。它提供女士、男士、年輕人、兒童、幼兒和嬰兒服裝，以及珠寶、配件和鞋子；以及美容產品，例如皮膚和沐浴護理、化妝品、護髮、口腔護理、除臭劑和剃須產品。該公司還提供食品和飲料產品，包括乾貨和易腐食品雜貨，包括零食、糖果、飲料、熟食店、麵包店、肉類、農產品和餐飲服務；電子產品，包括影片遊戲和控制台、玩具、體育用品、娛樂和行李箱；床和浴室、家居裝飾、學校/辦公用品、儲藏室、小家電、廚具、賀卡、派對用品、家具、照明、家居裝修和季節性商品；以及家庭必需品，例如家庭清潔、紙製品、非處方保健品、維生素和補充劑、嬰兒用品和寵物用品。此外，它還透過定期設計和創意合作以及店內商店體驗來銷售商品；和店內設施。該公司透過其商店銷售其產品；和數位管道，包括 Target.com。 Target Corporation 成立於 1902 年，總部位於明尼蘇達州明尼阿波利斯。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"折扣店","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":88.02,"h":88.07,"l":86.3,"c":86.56,"v":12449500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":86.89,"h":87.88,"l":86.73,"c":87.05,"v":8077800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":87.21,"h":88.34,"l":86.87,"c":88.31,"v":10691700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":87.81,"h":88.0,"l":86.53,"c":87.14,"v":8566300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":86.84,"h":88.59,"l":86.84,"c":87.85,"v":7575600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":88.36,"h":88.83,"l":87.31,"c":88.83,"v":7955600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":88.5,"h":90.21,"l":87.26,"c":89.7,"v":16872300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":89.48,"h":89.5,"l":87.26,"c":89.14,"v":10378500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":88.93,"h":90.28,"l":88.18,"c":89.51,"v":7557400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":89.8,"h":90.37,"l":88.28,"c":89.03,"v":6872000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":89.34,"h":90.17,"l":87.84,"c":88.96,"v":8975700},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":89.18,"h":90.09,"l":88.51,"c":89.27,"v":6348100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":89.62,"h":90.99,"l":89.54,"c":90.38,"v":6848500},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":90.99,"h":90.99,"l":88.62,"c":89.1,"v":7189200},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":89.18,"h":89.23,"l":85.36,"c":85.53,"v":13925200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":86.92,"h":88.35,"l":86.73,"c":87.34,"v":10515500},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":86.53,"h":89.4,"l":86.35,"c":88.96,"v":6352300},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":89.26,"h":91.19,"l":88.91,"c":90.91,"v":6402500},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":90.88,"h":91.65,"l":89.12,"c":90.07,"v":5556500},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":90.0,"h":90.96,"l":89.81,"c":90.84,"v":6461400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":91.0